      "content": "thanks, these are a good starting point. that's helpful.\n\ni want to flesh out a specific scene where these characters are actually interacting. let's do a high-pressure meeting about a massive merger. i want to show how their different \"vibes\" play out in a conflict.\n\ncan you write a short dialogue scene for this meeting? maybe it starts with a tense moment where someone's expertise is being questioned, and you can show how Marcus, Elena, and maybe David handle the pressure. i want to see how they communicate and who really holds the power in the room when things get heated.",
